<!--ID=FCB40C2B-1F9F-4C26-B1A1-CF8E67BE07D1;Version=1|{"Files":{}}-->
<!--ID=5B95B1CC-2C7B-494F-B746-CF22A0E779B7;Version=1|{"Locales":{"en-US":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]},"en-GB":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]}}}-->
<speak xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis"
       xmlns:mstts="http://www.w3.org/2001/mstts"
       xmlns:emo="http://www.w3.org/2009/10/emotionml"
       version="1.0"
       xml:lang="en-GB">
  <voice name="en-GB-OllieMultilingualNeural">
    <prosody rate="-12.25%" pitch="-3.10%">
      After the cupbearer forgot him, Joseph remained in prison through ordinary days that did not seem to change.<break time="500ms"/>
      The same doors.<break time="500ms"/>
      The same walls.<break time="500ms"/>
      The same slow turning of morning into evening.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Genesis does not tell us every detail of those two years.<break time="500ms"/>
      But it does show us the shape of Joseph's life.<break time="500ms"/>
      He stayed faithful in the place where he had been left.<break time="1800ms"/>

      He would have risen to the same sounds.<break time="500ms"/>
      Footsteps in stone corridors.<break time="500ms"/>
      Voices low behind iron and wood.<break time="500ms"/>
      Small tasks needing attention again.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Nothing about those days would have looked like the fulfillment of early dreams.<break time="500ms"/>
      No family bowing.<break time="500ms"/>
      No robe of favor.<break time="500ms"/>
      No visible sign that the story was moving toward mercy.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Yet hidden time is still time in God's hand.<break time="500ms"/>
      A quiet year is still a year God can hold.<break time="500ms"/>
      A delayed answer is still under His keeping.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Joseph could not force remembrance.<break time="500ms"/>
      He could not open the door by strength alone.<break time="500ms"/>
      He could only live the next faithful day.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Sometimes nothing seems to change except the heart learning to wait.<break time="500ms"/>
      Even there, God was not absent from the slow work being done within Joseph.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Sometimes that is the work set before a person.<break time="500ms"/>
      Not changing the season.<break time="500ms"/>
      Only remaining held within it.<break time="1800ms"/>

      The hidden years were not wasted years.<break time="1000ms"/>
      God was present in the waiting, even there.<break time="1000ms"/>
      You are not forgotten in waiting.<break time="1800ms"/>
      You can rest.<break time="3800ms"/>
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
